gin="1:27.535" end="1:27.811">て</span><span begin="1:27.811" end="1:28.107">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">渐渐变得越来越戏剧化</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">doramachikku ni kawatteku</span></p><p begin="1:28.319" end="1:32.415" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:28.319" end="1:28.605">目</span><span begin="1:28.605" end="1:28.823">を</span><span begin="1:28.823" end="1:29.084">そ</span><span begin="1:29.084" end="1:29.834">ら</span><span begin="1:29.834" end="1:30.165">す</span><span begin="1:30.165" end="1:30.453">よ</span><span begin="1:30.453" end="1:30.925">う</span><span begin="1:30.925" end="1:31.197">な</span><span begin="1:31.197" end="1:31.677">景</span><span begin="1:31.677" end="1:32.021">色</span><span begin="1:32.021" end="1:32.415">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就连叫人想移开目光的风景</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">me wo sorasu you na keshiki mo</span></p><p begin="1:32.508" end="1:36.395" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:32.508" end="1:32.753">ぜ</span><span begin="1:32.753" end="1:33.019">ん</span><span begin="1:33.019" end="1:33.275">ぶ</span><span begin="1:33.275" end="1:34.051">わ</span><span begin="1:34.051" end="1:34.272">た</span><span begin="1:34.272" end="1:35.126">し</span><span begin="1:35.126" end="1:35.366">だ</span><span begin="1:35.366" end="1:35.657">け</span><span begin="1:35.657" end="1:35.875">の</span><span begin="1:35.875" end="1:36.152">も</span><span begin="1:36.152" end="1:36.395">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也全都是只属于我的东西</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">zenbu watashi dake no mono</span></p><p begin="1:36.672" end="1:39.604" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:36.672" end="1:36.916">ひ</span><span begin="1:36.916" end="1:37.144">と</span><span begin="1:37.144" end="1:37.391">つ</span><span begin="1:37.391" end="1:37.987">も</span><span begin="1:37.987" end="1:38.253">あ</span><span begin="1:38.253" end="1:38.507">げ</span><span begin="1:38.507" end="1:39.0