:46.892" end="1:47.026">明</span><span begin="1:47.026" end="1:47.278">日</span><span begin="1:47.278" end="1:47.394">の</span><span begin="1:47.394" end="1:47.520">明</span><span begin="1:47.520" end="1:47.754">日</span><span begin="1:47.754" end="1:47.855">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明天的明天的明天的明天啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ashita no ashita no ashita no ashita wa</span></p><p begin="1:47.928" end="1:50.103" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:47.928" end="1:48.040">マ</span><span begin="1:48.040" end="1:48.179">シ</span><span begin="1:48.179" end="1:48.319">だ</span><span begin="1:48.319" end="1:48.467">と</span><span begin="1:48.467" end="1:48.569">い</span><span begin="1:48.569" end="1:48.650">い</span><span begin="1:48.650" end="1:48.775">よ</span><span begin="1:48.775" end="1:48.930">ね</span><span begin="1:48.930" end="1:49.097">こ</span><span begin="1:49.097" end="1:49.234">の</span><span begin="1:49.234" end="1:49.411">世</span><span begin="1:49.411" end="1:49.478">の</span><span begin="1:49.478" end="1:49.751">中</span><span begin="1:49.751" end="1:50.003">よ</span><span begin="1:50.003" end="1:50.103">り</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望那时候能比这个世界好一点呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">mashi da to ii yo ne kono yo no naka yori</span></p><p begin="1:50.310" end="1:52.010" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:50.310" end="1:50.417">天</span><span begin="1:50.417" end="1:50.689">国</span><span begin="1:50.689" end="1:50.805">な</span><span begin="1:50.805" end="1:50.896">ん</span><span begin="1:50.896" end="1:51.029">て</span><span begin="1:51.029" end="1:51.166">あ</span><span begin="1:51.166" end="1:51.274">る</span><span begin="1:51.274" end="1:51.400">わ</span><span begin="1:51.400" end="1:51.562">け</span><span begin="1:51.562" end="1:51.749">な</span><span begin="1:51.749" end="1:51.928">いっ</span><span begin="1:51.928" end="1:52.010">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">被告知“天国根本不存在”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">tengoku nante aru wake nai tte</span></p><p begin="1:52.054" end="1:54.136" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:52.054" end="1:52.318">宣</span><span begin="1:52.318" end="1:52.537">告</span><span begin="1:52.537" end="1:52.719">さ</span><span begin="1:52.719" end="1:52.871">れ</span><span begin="1:52.871" end="1:52.950">た</span><span begin="1:52.950" end="1:53.109">よ、</span><span begin="1:53.109" end="1:53.226">逃</span><span begin="1:53.226" end="1:53.359">げ</span><span begin="1:53.359" end="1:53.507">ら</span><span begin="1:53.507" end="1:53.613">れ</span><span begin="1:53.613" end="1:53.752">な</span><span begin="1:53.752" end="1:53.879">い</span><span begin="1:53.879" end="1:54.009">よ</span><span begin="1:54.009" end="1:54.136">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">被宣判了这一切，好像就是为了让我无处可逃</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">senkoku sareta yo, nigerarenai yo ni</span></p><p begin="1:54.385" end="1:55.994" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:54.385" end="1:54.503">誰</span><span begin="1:54.503" end="1:54.625">の</span><span begin="1:54.625" end="1:54.828">せ</span><span begin="1:54.828" end="1:54.937">い</span><span begin="1:54.937" end="1:55.132">だ</span> <span begin="1:55.132" end="1:55.316">誰</span><span begin="1:55.316" end="1:55.408">の</span><span begin="1:55.408" end="1:55.583">せ</span><span begin="1:55.583" end="1:55.726">い</span><span begin="1:55.726" end="1:55.994">か？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是谁的错？到底是谁的错？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">dare no sei da dare no sei ka?</span></p><p begin="1:56.476" end="1:58.318" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:56.476" end="1:56.856">は</span><span begin="1:56.856" end="1:57.210">や</span><span begin="1:57.210" end="1:57.514">く</span><span begin="1:57.514" end="1:57.727">逃</span><span begin="1:57.727" end="1:57.948">避</span><span begin="1:57.948" end="1:58.318">行</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">快些私奔吧</span><sp