37" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:32.228" end="2:32.475">ひ</span><span begin="2:32.475" end="2:32.735">と</span><span begin="2:32.735" end="2:33.014">つ</span><span begin="2:33.014" end="2:33.272">だ</span><span begin="2:33.272" end="2:33.816">け</span><span begin="2:33.816" end="2:34.134">言</span><span begin="2:34.134" end="2:34.335">っ</span><span begin="2:34.335" end="2:34.601">て</span><span begin="2:34.601" end="2:35.109">お</span><span begin="2:35.109" end="2:35.370">く</span><span begin="2:35.370" end="2:35.613">か</span><span begin="2:35.613" end="2:35.902">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我先跟你说好一件事</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hitotsu dake itte oku kara</span></p><p begin="2:36.453" end="2:40.295" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:36.453" end="2:36.678">呪</span><span begin="2:36.678" end="2:37.214">文</span><span begin="2:37.214" end="2:37.449">だ</span><span begin="2:37.449" end="2:37.712">け</span><span begin="2:37.712" end="2:37.959">じゃ</span><span begin="2:37.959" end="2:38.242">足</span><span begin="2:38.242" end="2:38.472">り</span><span begin="2:38.472" end="2:38.745">な</span><span begin="2:38.745" end="2:39.103">い</span><span begin="2:39.103" end="2:39.283">ん</span><span begin="2:39.283" end="2:39.499">だ</span><span begin="2:39.499" end="2:39.773">か</span><span begin="2:39.773" end="2:40.295">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">光靠咒语可不够</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">jumon dake ja tarinai n da kara</span></p><p begin="2:40.599" end="2:46.305" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:40.599" end="2:41.122">唱</span><span begin="2:41.122" end="2:41.392">え</span><span begin="2:41.392" end="2:41.624">て</span><span begin="2:41.624" end="2:42.142">よ</span><span begin="2:42.142" end="2:42.940">扉</span><span begin="2:42.940" end="2:43.785">開</span><span begin="2:43.785" end="2:43.998">い</span><span begin="2:43.998" end="2:46.305">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">咏唱吧 打开门扉</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">tonaete yo tobira hiraite</span></p><p begin="2:47.609" end="2:51.668" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:47.609" end="2:47.854">ド</span><span begin="2:47.854" end="2:48.116">ラ</span><span begin="2:48.116" end="2:48.382">マ</span><span begin="2:48.382" end="2:49.171">チッ</span><span begin="2:49.171" end="2:49.443">ク</span><span begin="2:49.443" end="2:50.207">に</span><span begin="2:50.207" end="2:51.013">輝</span><span begin="2:51.013" end="2:51.283">く</span><span begin="2:51.283" end="2:51.668">わ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">戏剧般地闪耀</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">doramachikku ni kagayaku wa</span></p><p begin="2:51.824" end="2:55.743" itunes:key="L41" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:51.824" end="2:52.068">ま</span><span begin="2:52.068" end="2:52.313">ば</span><span begin="2:52.313" end="2:52.551">た</span><span begin="2:52.551" end="2:53.303">き</span><span begin="2:53.303" end="2:53.607">す</span><span begin="2:53.607" end="2:54.364">ら</span><span begin="2:54.364" end="2:54.658">し</span><span begin="2:54.658" end="2:55.006">な</span><span begin="2:55.006" end="2:55.197">い</span><span begin="2:55.197" end="2:55.420">で</span><span begin="2:55.420" end="2:55.743">ね</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">连眨眼都别眨一下哦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">mabataki sura shinai de ne</span></p><p begin="2:55.972" end="2:59.884" itunes:key="L42" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:55.972" end="2:56.216">ほ</span><span begin="2:56.216" end="2:56.475">ら</span><span begin="2:56.475" end="2:56.712">マ</span><span begin="2:56.712" end="2:57.482">ジッ</span><span begin="2:57.482" end="2:57.772">ク</span><span begin="2:57.772" end="2:58.540">に</span><span begin="2:58.540" end="2:58.815">か</span><span begin="2:58.815" end="2:59.339">かっ</span><span begin="2:59.339" end="2:59.633">て</span><span begin="2:59.633" end="2:59.884">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">看吧 已经中了魔法</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hora majikku ni kakatteru</span></p><p begin="3:00.135" end="3:03.051" itunes:key="L43" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:00.135" end="3:00.634">悪</span><span begin="3:00.634" end="3:00.885">魔</span><span begin="3:00.885" end="3:01.164">み</span><span begin="3:01.164" end="3:01.414">た</span><span begin="3:01.414" end="3:01.682">い</span><span begin="3:01.682" end="3:01.937">な</span><span begin="3:01.937" end="3:02.357">恋</span><span begin="3:02.357" end="3:02.709">し</span><span begin="3:02.709" end="3:03.051">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">来一场恶魔般的恋爱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">akuma mitai na koishite</span></p><p begin="3:04.298" end="3:08.248" itunes:key="L44" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:04.298" end="3:04.540">ド</span><span begin="3:04.540" end="3:04.812">ラ</span><span begin="3:04.812" end="3:05.053">マ</span><span begin="3:05.053" end="3:05.850">チッ</span><span begin="3:05.850" end="3:06.119">ク</span><span begin="3:06.119" end="3:06.879">に</span><span begin="3:06.879" end="3:07.676">輝</span><span begin="3:07.676" end="3:07.924">く</span><span begin="3:07.924" end="3:08.248">わ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">戏剧般地闪耀</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">doramachikku ni kagayaku wa</span></p><p begin="3:08.490" end="3:12.377" itunes:key="L45" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:08.490" end="3:08.714">わ</span><span begin="3:08.714" end="3:08.949">が</span><span begin="3:08.949" end="3:09.232">ま</span><span begin="3:09.232" end="3:09.764">ま</span><span begin="3:09.764" end="3:10.020">ば</span><span begin="3:10.020" end="3:10.292">か</span><span begin="3:10.292" end="3:11.094">り</span><span begin="3:11.094" end="3:11.327">で</span><span begin="3:11.327" end="3:11.599">ご</span><span begin="3:11.599" end="3:11.865">め</span><span begin="3:11.865" end="3:12.128">ん</span><span begin="3:12.128" end="3:12.377">ね</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总是这么任性，对不起</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">wagamama bakari de gomen ne</span></p><p begin="3:12.672" end="3:16.554" itunes:key="L46" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:12.672" end="3:12.911">た</span><span begin="3:12.911" end="3:13.124">だ</span><span begin="3:13.124" end="3:13.407">そ</span><span begin="3:13.407" end="3:14.186">ば</span><span begin="3:14.186" end="3:14.431">に</span><span begin="3:14.431" end="3:15.261">い</span><span begin="3:15.261" end="3:15.498">て</span><span begin="3:15.498" end="3:15.684">ほ</span><span begin="3:15.684" end="3:16.017">し</span><span begin="3:16.017" end="3:16.314">い</span><span begin="3:16.314" end="3:16.554">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我只是想要你陪在身边</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">tada soba ni ite hoshii no</span></p><p begin="3:16.852" end="3:19.758" itunes:key="L47" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:16.852" end="3:17.079">わ</span><span begin="3:17.079" end="3:17.312">た</span><span begin="3:17.312" end="3:17.592">し</span><span begin="3:17.592" end="3:18.106">も</span><span begin="3:18.106" end="3:18.412">見</span><span begin="3:18.412" end="3:18.662">て</span><span begin="3:18.662" end="3:19.137">る</span><span begin="3:19.137" end="3:19.429">か</span><span begin="3:19.429" end="3:19.758">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我也在注视着你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">watashi mo miteru kara</span></p><p begin="3:21.015" end="3:24.971" itunes:key="L48" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:21.015" end="3:21.270">ド</span><span begin="3:21.270" end="3:21.510">ラ</span><span begin="3:21.510" end="3:21.742">マ</span><span begin="3:21.742" end="3:22.542">チッ</span><span begin="3:22.542" end="3:22.796">ク</span><span begin="3:22.796" end="3:23.586">に</span><span begin="3:23.586" end="3:24.394">輝</span><span begin="3:24.394" end="3:24.626">い</span><span begin="3:24.626" end="3:24.971">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">戏剧般地闪耀吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">doramachikku ni kagayaite</span></p><p begin="3:25.160" end="3:29.118" itunes:key="L49" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:25.160" end="3:25.430">ま</span><span begin="3:25.430" end="3:25.681">ば</span><span begin="3:25.681" end="3:25.929">た</span><span begin="3:25.929" end="3:26.700">き</span><span begin="3:26.700" end="3:26.996">す</span><span begin="3:26.996" end="3:27.780">ら</span><span begin="3:27.780" end="3:28.056">し</span><span begin="3:28.056" end="3:28.290">な</span><span begin="3:28.290" end="3:28.576">い</span><span begin="3:28.576" end="3:28.834">か</span><span begin="3:28.834" end="3:29.118">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我连眼都不会眨</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">mabataki sura shinai kara</span></p><p begin="3:29.344" end="3:33.272" itunes:key="L50" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:29.344" end="3:29.605">ほ</span><span begin="3:29.605" end="3:29.858">ら</span><span begin="3:29.858" end="3:30.110">マ</span><span begin="3:30.110" end="3:30.894">ジッ</span><span begin="3:30.894" end="3:31.171">ク</span><span begin="3:31.171" end="3:31.966">に</span><span begin="3:31.966" end="3:32.206">か</span><span begin="3:32.206" end="3:32.748">かっ</span><span begin="3:32.748" end="3:33.014">て</span><span begin="3:33.014" end="3:33.272">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">看吧 已经中了魔法</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hora majikku ni kakatteru</span></p><p begin="3:33.544" end="3:36.552" itunes:key="L51" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:33.544" end="3:33.787">悪</span><span begin="3:33.787" end="3:34.323">魔</span><span begin="3:34.323" end="3:34.564">み</span><span begin="3:34.564" end="3:34.867">た</span><span begin="3:34.867" end="3:35.101">い</span><span begin="3:35.101" end="3:35.341">な</span><span begin="3:35.341" end="3:35.833">恋</span><span begin="3:35.833" end="3:36.124">し</span><span begin="3:36.124" end="3:36.380">た</span><span begin="3:36.380" end="3:36.552">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想谈一场恶魔般的恋爱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">akuma mitai na koishitai</span></p><p begin="3:39.499" end="3:43.196" itunes:key="L52" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:39.499" e